 "description": "With a length overall of 11 metres, the flagship of the Antares line is the perfect illustration of a family cruiser. Stylish and contemporary, the powerboat focuses on space, comfort and safety.\nThe flybridge of the Antares 11 FLY blends seamlessly into the powerboat's profile and is the perfect way to enjoy the thrills of outdoor boating.",
