   "title": "Design extérieur",
   "intro": "The result of a new collaboration between BENETEAU and Sarrazin Design, the spirited modern silhouette is emphasized by the vast areas of glazing in the wheelhouse, providing optimum light on board. Lots of smart modular solutions make life on board very pleasant.",
