  {
   "kind": "slider-design-pleasure",
   "id": "anchor_main-points",
   "title": "MORE THAN A WEEKENDER",
   "intro": "With the hallmark of a weekender range whose qualities have stood the test of time for over 40 years, this wonderful family cruiser powerboat is designed for a multiple boating programmes, and therefore for a wide variety of fun leisure activities! Powered with up to 2 x 300 hp outboard engines she boasts fine performances.",
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "FLYBRIDGE",
     "text": "The flybridge is fitted with a starboard driving station with a contoured driving sea. Two facing port benches create a very delightful saloon.\nThe flybridge has an additional stern relaxation area, with a large sunpads. Options can be added, such as a bimini or a solar panel."
    },
    {
     "title": "INNOVATIONS",
     "text": "Her many innovative solutions ensure a high level of comfort: aft sun bench, side swim platform creating a sea-view terrace, flush deck connecting almost seamlessly with the cockpit and the wheelhouse."
    },
    {
     "title": "safety",
     "text": "High freeboards, large walkways, easy movement and excellent seakeeping behaviour ensure maximum safety on this large family cruiser powerboat."
    },
    {
     "title": "PERFORMANCES",
     "text": "Powerful outboard engines up to 2 x 300 hp and a well-protected hull ensure excellent performance."
    }
   ],
